    <Folder>
      <name>NH - Southern</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Worcester, Nashua and Portland RR</name>
        <description><![CDATA[K42<br>RDK1:41. Worcester, Nashua and Portland RR. This segment spans the Ma/NH state line to Merrimac River. In Nashua, it connects with... [see also RDK2:175].K85<br>K177<br>Worcester, Nashua and Portland (originally W, N and Rochester). Merrimack River to Windham. This segment needs significant field-checking.K85<br>K177<br>Worcester, Nashua and Portland. Windham to Fremont.K84<br>K85<br>K335<br>Brentwood to East Barrington]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#line-993399-5000</styleUrl>
