      <Placemark>
        <name><![CDATA[Wiscasset & Quebec R/R (Winslow Branch)]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[K23<br>This line was part of the 2-ft guage Wiscasset and Quebec R/R. The route shown here must be considered extremely approximate since the track is hard to follow from satellite/aerial photographs and, since the line only lasted 17 years, it never made it onto the U.S. Topographical maps. In particular, the track between Weeks Mills and South China.K22<br>This line was part of the 2-ft guage Wiscasset and Quebec R/R. The route shown here must be considered extremely approximate since the track is hard to follow from satellite/aerial photographs and, since the line only lasted 13 years, it never made it onto the U.S. Topographical maps.]]></description>
