      <Placemark>
        <name><![CDATA[Wiscasset & Quebec R/R]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[K82<br>Wiscasset to Albion via Weeks Mills.  Operated 1895 to 1933 as 2' gauge.  This line never was marked on the topographical maps so in places the route shown is VERY approximate!  Beyond Albion, the line was extended 11 more miles to Burnham but never operated (RDK2:13).<br>The section near Wiscasset is pretty much a complete guess.  North of the museum, it is much more accurate.]]></description>
